Login sequence:
---------------
The script should wait for the string " name" and respond with
"<user name> S". If a "[ESCAPE]" string occures while waiting it
should respond with two ASCII 27 chars (escape). The "S" after
user name tells the BBS that this is a script login, and the user
should end up in the script menu after login sequence.

Then the script should wait for "assword" and respond with the
user's password.
